# "Planeswalkers you control have '[-10]: ...'" (CR 613.1f): Bot1's Avatar gives it to Bot1's planeswalkers only. Both players
# have a Jace token with 10 loyalty (Bot1: Avatar's landfall 2 + Jace's Machinations 8; Bot2: Jace's Machinations 8 + Fatehold
# Charm's empower Jace 2). Bot1's Jace offers the -10 and uses it (the positive control; one land, so one counter on the
# Avatar, and the token is left with no loyalty and is put into the graveyard, ceasing to exist, CR 704.5i). On turn 2 Bot2's
# Jace, though it has the loyalty, is refused the -10: it is not Bot1's.

